    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# `sklearn.gaussian_process.correlation_models`.pure_nugget¶\n\n- \n`sklearn.gaussian_process.correlation_models.``pure_nugget` (*theta* ,*d* )[source]¶\n- Spatial independence correlation model (pure nugget). (Useful when one wants to solve an ordinary least squares problem!): ```\n                                   n\ntheta, d --> r(theta, d) = 1 if   sum |d_i| == 0\n                                 i = 1\n                           0 otherwise\n```\nParameters: **theta** : array_likeNone. **d** : array_likeAn array with shape (n_eval, n_features) giving the componentwise distances between locations x and x’ at which the correlation model should be evaluated. Returns: **r** : array_likeAn array with shape (n_eval, ) with the values of the autocorrelation model.",
    "markdown_length": 763,
